rom ccxp but there  are some things that we should not  expect now according to the same report  from the same person Alex P from the  cosmic circus they say that here are a  couple of interesting tidbits regarding  the upcoming Marvel Studios panel at  ccxb 2022 so this is specifically about  the Marvel Studios panel not about the  Sony panel Alex B tweeted here are a  couple of interesting tidbits regarding  the upcoming Marvel Studios panel at  ccxp22 from what I'm being told the  panel will run for about 45 minutes it  should start around 5 25 to 5 30 Eastern  time and that is PM then the Tweet  continued to say while the panel will  highlight the upcoming release of  Ant-Man and The Wasp quantumania Marvel  will also discuss other projects this  includes Guardians of the Galaxy vol 3  but I'm also being told by sources to  expect surprises perhaps a secret  Invasion or Loki update now I would love  to tell you that I think we're going to  be getting a Guardians of the Galaxy vol  3 teaser but I don't think that is the  case as at the time CC XP 2022 will  happen Guardians of the Galaxy vol 3  will be about six months away that's a  pretty long time ahead to release a  trailer however it does sound like we  are going to be getting a special look  at Ant-Man and the WASP Quantum Mania  which does make sense considering that  is the next project coming from Marvel  Studios and it comes out in February we  have the first trailer but we don't have  the full official trailer we've only  gotten the teaser so we are due a full  trailer I would say actually next month  so I would assume and this is just  speculation by my part not confirmed in  any way but I would assume that that's  when we're going to get the full trailer  for Ant-Man and the WASP Quantum Mania  now as far as Guardians 3 is concerned  they have actually showed footage for it  already they might indeed do the same  thing they showed footage for it at San  Diego Diego Comic-Con this year as well  as d23 at the time when the footage was  shown the footage was not completely  done as far as the VFX were concerned  however it does seem like they have what  they need to do a trailer and what they  showed us for Ant-Man and the WASP  quantumania at San Diego Comic-Con and  d23 was pretty much what we got for the  trailer that everybody ended up seeing  there were a few slight differences but  for the most part they were the same so  we could probably assume that Guardians  of the Galaxy 3 the footage that we've  seen is indeed going to be the trailer  and it does seem like they have that  done so there is a possibility that we  could get a trailer for Guardians 3 a  very quick little teaser but again I  would not expect that but we should  according to the cosmic circus be  expecting some surprises so it'll be  interesting to see what Marvel Studios  is going to give us now Sony we have  just learned today will not be attending  ccxb so as far as a big Spider-Man  announcement we probably aren't going to  get one because it is usually Sony who  handles the Spider-Man announcements now  the fact that Sony is not going to be  attending ccxp is I should say  interesting it's interesting because in  the past they have used ccxp to show  really really big things but also at the  same time if they wanted to make an  announcement specifically for Spider-Man  and just Spider-Man they might actually  opt to sit out of that and do something  with Marvel Studios and since the cosmic  circus is stating that Spider-Man 4 has  now shifted into a more advanced level  of pre-production that announcement  could be on its way and perhaps this is  why Sony is opting to sit out of ccxp  this year of course there are many  reasons why they would sit out but  considering the fact that a Spider-Man  announcement should be coming soon it  makes you wonder if they are planning  something also not to mention we have  now learned that Tom Holland's  Spider-Man is going to be in Spider-Man  acros