e movie  and face off against him and he's going  to be the villain there or Kingpin could  possibly be the villain over multiple  films which I hope Could Happen Kingpin  could be the villain for Spider-Man 4  then in Spider-Man 5 it could be about  the Venom symbiote but then in the last  Spider-Man film of the trilogy it could  kind of be another Sinister Six film  with Kingpin the Venom symbiote scorpion  who was introduced and we never really  saw anything else from maybe vulture  returns and maybe we get Prowler because  Donald Glover's character was indeed  Prowler who knows but I think this could  be a great build up to a final  Spider-Man movie with Tom Holland  whatever it may be does seem like an  announcement is pretty imminent and it  does look like some big announcements  are coming from Marvel Studios pretty  soon so be sure to subscribe to the  channel and hit that notification Bell  so you don't miss out on any of the  latest videos and for live updates be  sure to follow us on Instagram and  Twitter and as always thank you all so  much for watching wolf wolf

